{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the distant future, humanity drifts through space, searching for a new home. As Detective Darren, you\u2019ve made a living solving the dirty secrets of the wealthy\u2014but this case is different. A renowned scientist has slaughtered his colleagues aboard a research station and locked away all critical data. The fate of the Enceladus Project now rests in your hands. To uncover the truth, you must use a unique technique to enter his mind\u2014a twisted and dangerous world where the boundaries of reality blur. This first-person platformer-puzzle investigation will challenge your perception, where every decision matters, and the truth may be far darker than you ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Investigation:</strong> Enter the mind of a criminal to uncover hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surreal Worlds:</strong> Explore dreamlike environments where reality bends and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Solve intricate puzzles using a unique perception-based mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sci-Fi Mystery:</strong> Unravel a gripping narrative set in the depths of space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack:</strong> Haunting music enhances the tension and immersion.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522860?t=1747218045","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747218045","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/059d8e44a587504941a62a71ce83d80a241ddc82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747218045","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/059d8e44a587504941a62a71ce83d80a241ddc82/capsule_184